n【运镜】缓慢向前推镜\n【动作】女子骤然上前一步，衣袖迎风翻涌，仰头凝泪，死死望向男子。男子慌忙后退半步，攥紧腰间玉佩，身躯微颤。\n【环境音效】秋虫凄鸣、池水涟漪声、女子哽咽喘息、绸缎摩擦沙沙声\n【台词｜女声，颤抖哀求，含泪绝望】\n“郎君，同我远走高飞好不好？”\n画面 3-7 秒\n【主体】双人过肩镜头，半身取景。男子满脸挣扎苦痛，女子眼底满怀希冀。\n【动作】男子闭眼忍痛，扭头望向假山，不敢对视。女子眸中光亮骤然熄灭，折扇无力垂落，肩头不住发抖。\n【环境音效】沉郁叹息、竹林风声、扇身轻撞衣料闷响\n【台词｜男声低沉愧疚，满心挣扎，刻意躲闪】\n“我家中尚有高堂，万万不能离去。”\n画面 7-10 秒\n【主体】手持微晃脸部特写，珍珠耳坠在灯火下微光摇曳\n【动作】女子情绪彻底崩塌，泪珠滚落砸落红衣，弃扇掩面，身子发软缓缓跪倒青石地上。男子伸手欲扶，僵停在半空。\n【环境音效】泪水滴落声、膝盖磕石板闷响，古风箫乐缓缓响起，女子崩溃哭声\n【台词｜女声嘶哑崩溃，满心委屈痛楚】\n“没有你，长夜我该如何熬过……”", "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_text_encoder", "link": 9, "label": "h3_text_encoder", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TEXT_ENCODER", "localized_name": "h3_text_encoder"}, {"name": "h3_vae_bundle", "link": 10, "label": "h3_vae_bundle", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_VAE_BUNDLE", "localized_name": "h3_vae_bundle"}, {"name": "target", "link": 11, "label": "target", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TARGET", "localized_name": "target"}, {"name": "references", "link": 8, "label": "references", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_REFERENCES", "localized_name": "references"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "ref_image_size"}, "shape": 7, "name": "ref_image_size", "label": "ref_image_size", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ref_image_size"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [448.2731628417969, 546.7102661132812], "pos": [0, 840], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode"}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [{"name": "sampled_av_latent", "slot_index": 0, "links": [3], "label": "sampled_av_latent", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_AV_LATENT", "localized_name": "sampled_av_latent"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [42, "fixed", 50, 12, 3, "manual-velocity", true, 0.12, 2, 4, 4, "euler", true], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_model", "link": 13, "label": "h3_model", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_DIRECT_MODEL", "localized_name": "h3_model"}, {"name": "conditioning", "link": 14, "label": "c